{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "ん〜てれさぱんだ発見(▭-▭)✧🫵🏻！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんにちは、池田瑛紗です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いけだてれさと読みます よろしくお願いしますᓀ ·̫.ᓂ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "おしらせです！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本日12月12日（金）の20:00からJ-WAVE「INNOVATION WORLD」に生出演します！　いつもお世話になっているINNOVATION WORLDですが生出演は初めてです😳緊張しますが…頑張ります！ぜひお聞きください📻‎🤍"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mobtsiOkD.png", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "新制服です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "意外とちゃんと写真を載せたことは少ないかも…？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "レイヤーのおかげで髪が少し短く見えますね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mobRcXV6c.png", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本当はこんな感じ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ジャケットとワンピースのブラウンの千鳥格子が秋っぽくて探偵さんのコスチュームチックでお気に入りです🕵️‍♀️🔍！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そういえば、次の新しいプリキュアの名前が『名探偵プリキュア』らしいですよ！何気に毎年ちゃんとチェックしてます🤭"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今年は『キミとアイドルプリキュア』だったからなんだか嬉しかったり…( *´꒳`)キュアキュンキュンがみくだーって話したりしてました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ちなみに私がハチオーグだって勝手に湧いているこちら"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mobXx9rV4.png", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "🐝⋆゜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "黒×金や金屏風感じるボリューミーなスカート"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "和洋折衷で久保さんらしくて、楽曲、メンバー、ライブの魅力を引き出してくれる 魔法ですね！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "モデルさんのように、こういった衣装だったり洋服を素敵に着こなしたくてダイエットも頑張れるし…しすぎは禁物ですよ！もちろん"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "前回のブログにも書いたけれど、素敵な人と、景色と、こうして素敵な衣装にも出会わせてもらえるアイドルという職業はとてもしあわせだなって思います"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "デザイナーさん衣装さんスタッフさんにいつも感謝の気持ちでいっぱいです☺️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "良かったら皆さんの好きなもののお話も聞かせてください！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "forTUNE music"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ただいまアルバム『My respect』のオンラインミーグリの受付中です 今日の14時まで\\ _(   •̆ .̫•́  ) ｺｺ重要!!"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私たち5期生にとっても初めてのアルバムです またこうしてお話出来る機会をいただけてとてもうれしいです よかったらまってます^^"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "''今 あなたと わたしを つなぐ願いがあるから"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "虹を 超えて会いにゆける！''"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "#てれぶろ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "#341"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "叶えるために夢を見られるなら何になりたいですか？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私はね…正義の味方！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "う…でもね キュアパッションも好きだけどイースが大好きだったんだよ〜！！！"}], "source": "official"}